# Header active nav inset capsule (required)

The desktop main nav **must** mark the current page with a shallow recessed capsule on `.main-nav > li.active > a`, desktop only (`min-width: 1367px`). Matches mockup option 07.

## Treatment

- Soft stone wash `rgba(84, 55, 39, 0.06)` plus inset shadow (carved plaster, not a gold fill)
- Existing `border-radius: var(--radius-pill)` on the L1 link
- Desktop L1 labels stay `#543727` (default, hover, open, active)
- Segment accent colors still apply to mega-menu panel chrome via `--nav-accent`

## Do not re-add

- Recessed cove / pendant light PNG (`nav-light-opt03-true-alpha.png`)
- Baseline tick, top-edge reveal, or full underline
- Quiet gold type on the active label
- Soft accent / gold pill fill on desktop active items
